{"product_id":"wildlife-painting-step-by-step","title":"Wildlife Painting Step by Step","description":"\u003cp\u003eThrough step-by-step demonstrations and magnificent paintings, Patrick Seslar and 13 distinguished artists reveal how to turn oils, watercolors, acrylics or pastels into creatures with fur, feathers or scales. Artists will find information on: Field sketching, photographic references, zoos, and other avenues of research; Animal habitats - how to place animals in the proper settings, create a mood and relate subject to background; Using light, colors and patterns to move the viewer's eye; Painting the texture of fur, fish scales and feathers. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:216 x 279  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Patrick Seslar \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781581800869 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 148\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43564243714201,"sku":"4RA9781581800869","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/a0dffede6f207c8a5c544c40e02da004.jpg?v=1699253148","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/wildlife-painting-step-by-step","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}